  "reasons": [
    "N136–N140 move to the end of Safety and Readiness so readers can find human support before beginning the exercises.",
    "N008 becomes level 2 because monitoring therapy aftereffects applies beyond the body-based approaches in N007.",
    "N009 becomes level 2 because finding a willingness to begin is a readiness question, not a somatic-therapy subtopic.",
    "N014 merges into N013 as the closing thought of the same spiritual discussion, leaving immediate crisis action separately accessible in N012.",
    "N027 merges into N023 so intentional protective actions, reviewing them, and earning trust over time form one practical sequence.",
    "N034 moves immediately after N030; goodwill offers the smaller starting point that N030 introduces.",
    "N034, N031 and N032 become level 4 under N030, grouping three ways to begin when warmth is missing.",
    "N042 merges into N041 because keeping a visible reminder is a continuation of making and keeping the vow.",
    "N044 becomes level 4 under N043 because grief opening into deeper joy develops that discussion of possible happiness.",
    "N058–N061 merge into N057 so responses, silence, requests and anxiety can be read together without four tiny contents entries.",
    "N066 moves before N065 so ending a practice session precedes the separate morning-and-evening routine.",
    "N070 merges into N069 because the memory exercise directly completes the shame section’s introduction to it.",
    "N084–N086 merge into N083 so deciding whether to persist, adapt or stop occupies one useful troubleshooting entry.",
    "N126 moves after N088 at level 3 so medical self-advocacy is beside the pain-care discussion that makes it relevant.",
    "N090–N104 move after everyday-life integration so intensive altered-state work follows ordinary practice and its application.",
    "N097 becomes level 4 under N096 because it explains the trusted advisors mentioned there.",
    "N101 becomes level 3 under N093 because the personal account illustrates the preceding discussion of destabilizing experiences.",
    "N104 becomes level 5 because its social-media analogy closes the discussion without needing its own navigation entry.",
    "N116 merges into N115, giving the empty social-support heading its concise introduction without another contents entry.",
    "N120 becomes level 5 because the brief listening prompt can remain in the text without interrupting the social-support contents.",
    "N130 merges into N129 so realistic expectations about change stay with the discussion of recurring relationship patterns.",
    "N131 becomes level 3 so readers can find unsafe-relationship concerns directly alongside other conflict topics.",
    "N141 drops and N142 and N143 become level 1, separating the actual conclusion from the reference appendix.",
    "N144 becomes level 2 over N145 and N146; N147 becomes level 2 over N148, separating therapy comparisons from framework origins and resources."
  ]
